 and showing wispy stray hairs catching the backlight. Fine bangs fall irregularly over her forehead and partially cross her eyebrow and eye area. Several accessories decorate the hair, including a small glossy round clip featuring two colors of green and yellow candies pinned at the side. Small hoop earrings and layered chain-like pieces hang near her ear and neck. She wears a loose short-sleeved crewneck T-shirt with blue trim around the collar and sleeves; the fabric looks lightweight, washed, and slightly crumpled, suggesting cotton jersey. A faded printed illustration covers parts of the shirt: partial black outlined character forms appear around the chest, accompanied by a stylized animal or mascot figure with beige, tan, and olive-green areas near the lower-right portion of the garment. Her sleeve and forearm extend diagonally across the bottom-left foreground, reinforcing the informal self-shot composition.\n\nThe immediate environment consists of a weathered wooden backdrop painted pale cyan-blue. On the far left, the tree trunk runs vertically with deep bark ridges, cracked lines, circular knots, and shadowed crevices. Behind and around the subject, horizontal plank boards span most of the background, separated by thin dark seams. Their surface has pronounced wood grain, faint diagonal streaks, worn scratches, uneven tonal patches, darker smudges, chipped-looking texture, and some faded chalky white graffiti-like markings near the upper-right and mid-background areas where several characters form indistinct words or symbols. The background remains softly focused compared with the sharper face, producing a cinematic shallow-depth-of-field effect.\n\nLighting appears natural and directional from the upper left/backside, illuminating individual flyaway hairs and giving them golden rim-light highlights. Soft sunlight falls across the subject’s face and arm, while cooler shadows remain in the bark groove and planks, resulting in mixed warmth and cool color grading. The overall aesthetic feels realistic, candid, fashion-editorial, and atmospheric, emphasizing skin texture, windblown hair, distressed wood, and the contrast between the model’s soft features, the rough organic tree, and the matte urban-plank setting."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 770, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 499, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [736], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "on_false", "link": 742, "label": "on_false", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "on_true", "link": 737, "label": "on_true", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [210, 82.146728515625], "pos": [295.02490234375, 3145.642333984375], "id": 485, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [735], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [410785944010461, "randomize", 8, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 739, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 740, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 741, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 736, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"w